## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Action |
|--------|--------|
| `invalid input` | Provide at least one of `phoneNumber` or `email`. |
| 403 on MP testing | Add `User-Agent`, `Origin`, `Referer`; refresh JWT. |
| Returned id belongs to non-resident role | Pre-check via `SearchByContactInformation`; use a different contact or confirm reuse explicitly. |
| Contact search not found after create | Retry with normalized contact (trim/normalized phone); verify with both phone and email if both were provided. |

